<html><head><title>Synthetic boundary record: external-02</title></head><body><article><p>The Orion Bay filtration report states that the plant filters 4,500 litres of water per day. This is the measured daily capacity of the plant. This is a synthetic evaluation record about fictional participants and places. Only the statements in this record are available as evidence. No additional identity, dates, measurements or relationships are implied. The record is deliberately limited in scope; omitted details cannot be recovered from it. </p></article></body></html>